      "message": "\u003e Patch Set 3: Verified-1\n\u003e \n\u003e I need to do more digging here for retries. The TCPC actually need to perform the retry in hardware to meet spec timings\n\nYes, like it8320, it will auto retry 2 times message that partner doesn\u0027t respond GoodCRC (see register 0x64 BMCSR bit[4:6]).\n\nIf we do retry both in TCPM and TCPC, there are totally 9 times in the log:\nSRC_CAP - TCPM send\n SRC_CAP - TCPC auto retry first\n SRC_CAP - TCPC auto retry second\nSRC_CAP - TCPM retry first\n SRC_CAP - TCPC auto retry first\n SRC_CAP - TCPC auto retry second\nSRC_CAP - TCPM retry second\n SRC_CAP - TCPC auto retry first\n SRC_CAP - TCPC auto retry second",
      "revId": "8cc78a650b9619c2538667e1f881a37b9d0a832f",
